required (Core 2 Duo, Athlon X2 or newer)."],["Memory","2048 MB RAM"],["Graphics","OpenGL 3.1 or higher required (Intel HD series, NVIDIA GeForce 8000 series, AMD Radeon HD series or newer)"],["Storage","2 GB available space"]],"rec":[["Processor","Quad core processor, Intel Core i5, AMD Athlon X4 or better"],["Memory","4096 MB RAM"],["Graphics","NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon with 1024MB VRAM recommended."]],"deck":3,"blurb":"On Rusty Trails is a quick-reflex platformer built around a single idea: the world only tolerates things that look like it. Your character can switch form on the fly, and matching the right shape at the right moment decides whether a part of the level treats you as a friend or as a threat. Getting through a stage means changing your look constantly while running and jumping.\n\nIt is a single-player game from the small studio Black Pants, with short, demanding levels that reward practice and quick decisions. It suits platformer fans who enjoy trial and error, tight timing and a puzzle twist layered on top of the running and jumping."}}